sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor TDen as Treating Dentist
    actor Rec as Receptionist
    actor XDen as X-Ray Dentist (Dr. Hung)
    participant API as ClinicalDiagnosticsController
    participant Svc as ImagingService
    participant DB as SQL Server

    TDen->>API: POST /api/clinical-diagnostics/orders (AppointmentServiceId, ClinicalIndication)
    API->>Svc: CreateDiagnosticOrderAsync(treatingDentistId, request)
    Svc->>DB: INSERT Diagnostics (Status='Ordered', ImagingType='Panoramic', ClinicalIndication)
    DB-->>TDen: Diagnostic Order Created

    Rec->>API: POST /api/clinical-diagnostics/sessions/book (OrderId, Room R003, XrayDentistId, LocalTime->UTC)
    API->>Svc: BookImagingSessionAsync(recUserId, bookRequest)
    Svc->>DB: Verify XrayDentist has CanPerformXray=1 & active shift in StaffWorkSchedules
    Svc->>DB: Preserve original consultation Room/Chair on treating AppointmentService!
    Svc->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE imaging AppointmentServices (RoomId=R003, DentalChairId=NULL, AssignedDentistUserId=XrayDentist)
    Rec->>API: POST /api/clinical-diagnostics/sessions/{id}/check-in
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE imaging AppointmentServices SET Status='CheckedIn', QueueNumber=@stt

    XDen->>API: POST /api/clinical-diagnostics/sessions/{id}/start
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE Diagnostics SET Status='InProgress'
    XDen->>API: POST /api/clinical-diagnostics/results/upload (PNG/DICOM file + Findings)
    API->>Svc: UploadDiagnosticResultAsync & CompleteImagingSessionAsync
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE Diagnostics SET FileUrl=@url, Findings=@text, UploadedByUserId=@xden, Status='Completed', CompletedAt=SYSDATETIME()
    Svc->>DB: INSERT Notifications (Recipient = OrderingDentistUserId)

    TDen->>API: GET /api/clinical-diagnostics/results/{id}/image & POST /review
    API->>Svc: Verify caller is OrderingDentist / AssignedDentist -> Stream image bytes
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE Diagnostics SET ReviewedByDentistUserId=@tden, ReviewedAt=SYSDATETIME()